    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 26]\ntheorem mathoverflow_347178 :\n    answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ᵉ (n ≥ 2) (f : ℝ^n → ℝ) (hf : ContDiff ℝ 1 f),\n        (BddAbove (range f) ↔ BddAbove (range (fun x ↦ f (x + gradient f x)))) ∧\n        (⨆ x, (f x : EReal)) = ⨆ x, (f (x + gradient f x) : EReal)",
